# WorldGraph configuration
#
# Copy to backend/.env and edit. Every value here is optional: WorldGraph boots with no
# credentials at all, which is what makes the demo reproducible on any machine.
#
# NOTHING IN THIS FILE EVER REACHES THE BROWSER except the two tile tokens at the bottom,
# which Cesium requires client-side and which are therefore opt-in, referrer-restricted,
# and documented in SECURITY.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run mode
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEMO    — replay fixtures only. Deterministic, offline-safe. The default.
# LIVE    — additionally poll USGS earthquakes and the CISA KEV catalog.
# OFFLINE — replay fixtures only, with no outbound network calls at all.
WORLDGRAPH_RUN_MODE=DEMO

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Storage
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SQLite path. Use ":memory:" for a throwaway instance.
WORLDGRAPH_DATABASE_PATH=worldgraph.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI analyst (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without a key, WorldGraph uses its deterministic intent router over the same tools.
# The hero demo runs identically either way; the model adds language, not facts.
# WORLDGRAPH_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# WORLDGRAPH_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# WORLDGRAPH_AI_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=1400
# WORLDGRAPH_AI_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Limits
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WORLDGRAPH_AI_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=20
WORLDGRAPH_ANALYSIS_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=120

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CORS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if the frontend is served from an origin other than the Vite dev proxy.
# WORLDGRAPH_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173"]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional imagery (client-visible — see SECURITY.md)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cesium Ion, for higher-quality terrain and imagery. Without it WorldGraph renders from
# Cesium's bundled Natural Earth II imagery, which needs no account.
# WORLDGRAPH_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles. A PAID Google Maps Platform product with mandatory
# on-screen attribution. Deliberately not a default dependency — requiring it would make
# the demo unreproducible. Read Google's terms before enabling.
# WORLDGRAPH_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
